# Terraform
**/.terraform/*
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
crash.log
crash.*.log
tfplan
*.tfplan
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json
.terraformrc
terraform.rc
# NOTE: .terraform.lock.hcl is intentionally NOT ignored - commit it so
# provider versions stay reproducible across machines.

# Credentials / secrets
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
.env
.env.*
credentials
aws_credentials

# Lambda build artifacts
*.zip
lambda/**/node_modules/
lambda/**/__pycache__/
lambda/**/*.pyc
lambda/**/venv/
lambda/**/.venv/

# Raw investigation evidence.
# CloudTrail records contain the analyst's real source IP address and, on
# AssumeRole events, the issued session token. Keep the raw JSON local and
# publish only the redacted write-up.
incidents/**/evidence/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.vscode/
.idea/
